OL,3,AHundreds evacuated from
OL,4,ARussian-occupied Oleshky during rare
OL,5,AUkraine ceasefire
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour planes carrying Oleshky residents
OL,8,Flanded in the city of Gomel, Belarus on
OL,9,FSaturday morning, Ukrainian MP David
OL,10,FArakhamia said.
OL,12,FThe evacuees are expected to board
OL,13,Fbuses to drive across the border into
OL,14,FUkraine's Chernihiv region later on
OL,15,FSaturday.
